---
import { sitePath } from '../utils/paths';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CallButton from '../components/CallButton.astro';
import { business, services } from '../config/business';
---
<Layout title="800Roofs.com | Pittsburgh, PA Roofing Company" description="800Roofs.com is a local roofing company owned by Kevin, serving Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania only. Explore roofing information and discuss your Pittsburgh roof.">
<section class="hero"><img class="hero-photo" src={sitePath('/images/roofing.webp')} width="1600" height="1067" alt="Architectural rooflines on a residential home; illustrative stock photography" fetchpriority="high"/><div class="wrap"><div class="hero-content"><div class="eyebrow">PITTSBURGH, PA · OWNED BY KEVIN</div><h1>A better roof.<br/><em>A better feeling<br/>of home.</em></h1><p>Your roof deserves a thoughtful conversation. Start with Kevin at 800Roofs.com, serving homeowners in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania.</p><div class="hero-actions"><CallButton/><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/services/')}>Explore roofing services →</a></div><div class="hero-note">{business.phoneDisplay || business.phone || 'Kevin’s phone number · awaiting verification'}<br/>Illustrative stock photography. Not a completed 800Roofs.com project.</div></div></div></section>
<div class="strip"><div class="wrap"><span>01 / A LOCAL COMPANY</span><span>02 / OWNED BY KEVIN</span><span>03 / START WITH A CONVERSATION</span></div></div>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">YOUR ROOF, YOUR NEXT STEP</div><h2>Good roofing starts<br/>with understanding.</h2></div><p>Learn what goes into caring for a roof, then talk with Kevin about your property and the available options.</p></div><p class="notice">Proposed services below are awaiting Kevin’s confirmation. Availability and project scope must be verified before booking.</p><div class="grid">{services.map((service,i)=><article class="card"><span class="card-number">0{i+1} / ROOFING</span><h3>{service.title}</h3><p>{service.detail}</p><a href={sitePath(`/services/${service.slug}/`)}>Explore {service.title.toLowerCase()} ↗</a></article>)}</div></section>
<section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><div><div class="eyebrow accent">A PERSON BEHIND THE NAME</div><h2>Meet Kevin.<br/>Start with your roof.</h2><p class="lede">800Roofs.com is a local roofing company owned by Kevin. Have a roofing question? A conversation is the first step toward understanding your options.</p><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/about/')}>About 800Roofs.com →</a></div><div><div class="eyebrow accent">WHAT TO DISCUSS</div><div class="steps"><div class="step"><span>01</span><div><strong>Tell Kevin what you’re seeing.</strong><p>Describe leaks, visible wear, or what you’re planning.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>02</span><div><strong>Ask about your options.</strong><p>Confirm service availability and how your roof can be evaluated.</p></div></div><div class="step"><span>03</span><div><strong>Understand the scope.</strong><p>Discuss materials, timing, and costs before making a decision.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">BEFORE & AFTER</div><h2>The difference is in the details.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href={sitePath('/projects/')}>View project gallery →</a></div><div class="project-grid"><div class="project-placeholder"><b>Before · photo pending</b><span>Verified project photography to be supplied</span></div><div class="project-placeholder"><b>After · photo pending</b><span>Matching completed project photo to be supplied</span></div></div><p class="notice">Gallery placeholders. No completed projects, locations, or outcomes are being claimed.</p></section>
<section class="cta"><div class="wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow">LET’S TALK ABOUT YOUR ROOF</div><h2>A clear next step starts here.</h2><p>{business.cities.length ? `Serving only ${business.cities.join(', ')}.` : 'Service area: awaiting Kevin’s confirmation.'}</p></div><CallButton/></div></section>
</Layout>
